Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.74,0:04:34.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没办法再跟他共度一个夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.31,0:04:36.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you remember how he behaved at our wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.31,0:04:36.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你记得他在我们的婚礼上做了什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.59,0:04:39.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} No.  That's because he wasn't invited.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.59,0:04:39.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不记得  那是因为我们没有邀请他
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.65,0:04:42.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because of the way he behaved at our engagement party.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.65,0:04:42.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为他在我们的订婚派对上为非作歹
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.39,0:04:46.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah! Urine cuts right through an ice sculpture, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.39,0:04:46.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  小便直接喷中了冰雕  对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.62,0:04:56.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi! I went by the photo shop. Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.62,0:04:56.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我去过照相馆了  你看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.91,0:04:59.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here is a mockup of our card. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.91,0:04:59.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是卡片的初稿  你觉得怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.41,0:05:05.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.41,0:05:05.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.23,0:05:07.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you think it should say, "Love, Ross and Mona"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.23,0:05:07.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得我们该写上"爱你们的罗斯跟蒙娜"吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.88,0:05:11.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, we haven't said that to each other yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.88,0:05:11.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们还没有对彼此说过"爱"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.70,0:05:17.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but I guess it's okay to say it to other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.70,0:05:17.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我猜跟其他人说说应该没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.31,0:05:18.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How many did you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.31,0:05:18.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要多少张
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.25,0:05:20.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} I'll get 100. A hundred?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.25,0:05:20.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要100张  100张
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.63,0:05:26.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I guess I'll take...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.63,0:05:26.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那我就要...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.16,0:05:28.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mona?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.16,0:05:28.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}蒙娜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.15,0:05:35.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not sure about the whole card thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.15,0:05:35.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不确定印卡片这件事妥不妥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.51,0:05:37.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.51,0:05:37.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗  为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.71,0:05:41.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sending out a holiday card together?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.71,0:05:41.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们一起寄节日贺卡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.97,0:05:46.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just don't know if we're really quite there yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.97,0:05:46.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道我们之间是不是到那个地步了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.57,0:05:51.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't think of it that way. You're right. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.57,0:05:51.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没想到那一点  你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.51,0:05:57.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} So can I ask you a question?  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.51,0:05:57.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我能问你一个问题吗  好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.66,0:05:58.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.66,0:05:58.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们到哪个地步了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.51,0:06:03.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, like where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.51,0:06:03.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们到哪个地步了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.29,0:06:05.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where is this relationship going?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.29,0:06:05.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们会有什么结局
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.88,0:06:14.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, I love spending time with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.88,0:06:14.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢跟你待在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:16.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just hope we're moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:16.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是希望我们在往前走
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.15,0:06:18.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We should talk about that, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.15,0:06:18.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们该谈一谈  你不觉得吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.57,0:06:29.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's do the card!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.57,0:06:29.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们一起印卡片吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.07,0:06:34.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} What?  The card! I think we're there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.07,0:06:34.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么  卡片  我想我们到这个地步了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.07,0:06:39.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. But I still think we should have this conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.07,0:06:39.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  但我还是觉得我们应该谈一谈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.00,0:06:40.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.00,0:06:40.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.29,0:06:43.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Even with the card?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.29,0:06:43.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}印了卡片还是要谈吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.34,0:06:52.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just so you know, Dr. Long can't be here today,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.34,0:06:52.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}朗医生今天没办法过来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.17,0:06:55.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}she was called to the hospital, so Dr. Schiff will be seeing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.17,0:06:55.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她有事去医院了  辛夫医生会帮你检查
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.04,0:06:58.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, okay. Can I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.04,0:06:58.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  我能问你一个问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.58,0:07:01.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Was it me, or was the guy who took my blood sample
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.58,0:07:01.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是我的问题  还是帮我抽血的那个家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.05,0:07:02.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}really cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.05,0:07:02.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的很帅
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.50,0:07:04.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know who I'm talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.50,0:07:04.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道我在说谁吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.88,0:07:07.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bowl haircut, hairy fingers?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.88,0:07:07.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}锅盖头  手指满是毛的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.50,0:07:13.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Hi, Rachel? I'm Dr. Schiff.  Yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.50,0:07:13.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋吗  我是辛夫医生  是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.47,0:07:17.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, how's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.47,0:07:17.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}情况如何
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.24,0:07:20.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's going really good. But enough about me! Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.24,0:07:20.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的很不错  但别谈我了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.77,0:07:23.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where are you from? What do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.77,0:07:23.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是哪里人  你是做哪一行的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.30,0:07:28.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} I'm a doctor.  Right. I meant...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.30,0:07:28.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是医生  对  我是指...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.34,0:07:31.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...in your spare time. Do you cook? So you ski?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.34,0:07:31.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有空的时候  你会煮饭或滑雪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.80,0:07:34.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or just hang out with your wife, or girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.80,0:07:34.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还是会跟太太或女朋友一起出去玩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.76,0:07:38.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't have a wife or a girlfriend, but I do like to ski.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.76,0:07:38.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有太太或女朋友  但我很喜欢滑雪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.50,0:07:42.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I love to ski! How amazing is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.50,0:07:42.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也喜欢滑雪  我们简直太有缘了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.62,0:07:45.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you experiencing any discomfort?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.62,0:07:45.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你最近有任何不适症状吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.75,0:07:47.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I'm very comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.75,0:07:47.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  我非常舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.29,0:07:50.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Any painful gas?  No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.29,0:07:50.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}放屁会不舒服吗  不会
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.90,0:07:56.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No! Shoot, Dr. Schiff! What kind of question is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.90,0:07:56.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}辛夫医生  那是哪门子的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.18,0:08:01.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, then. Would you like to lie down on the table?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.18,0:08:01.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  能麻烦你躺下来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.17,0:08:03.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Would you like me to lie down on the table?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.17,0:08:03.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想让我躺下来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.26,0:08:06.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry. Is there something going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.26,0:08:06.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉  我们之间是不是有什么情况
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.99,0:08:08.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you feel it too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.99,0:08:08.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你也感觉到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.84,0:08:17.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, how did your doctor's appointment go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.84,0:08:17.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}门诊看得如何
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.11,0:08:18.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, let's see,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.11,0:08:18.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我想一想
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.09,0:08:21.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}they gave me "cute boy" doctor today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.09,0:08:21.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今天他们派了一个"帅哥"医生给我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.39,0:08:25.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In the middle of the exam, I put my pinkie in his chin dimple.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.39,0:08:25.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}检查到一半  我把小指放到他的下巴酒窝里了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.93,0:08:29.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Oh, my God!  Why did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.93,0:08:29.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  你为什么要那么做
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.34,0:08:30.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Remember that little problem
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.34,0:08:30.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还记得我怀孕四个月时
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.97,0:08:33.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was having during my fourth month of pregnancy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.97,0:08:33.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}遇到的那个小问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.58,0:08:36.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah! The Evander Holyfield phase.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.58,0:08:36.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  艾凡德·霍利菲尔德的人形立牌
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.78,0:08:40.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, man! You were so hard up, you practically came on to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.78,0:08:40.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  你当时病急乱投医  甚至朝我扑过来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.02,0:08:42.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.02,0:08:42.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}少做梦了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.66,0:08:45.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, I could have had you if I wanted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.66,0:08:45.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我真的想要你  完全可以钓到你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.91,0:08:48.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah? Come and get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.91,0:08:48.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗  来试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.91,0:08:51.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, even this is turning me on...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.91,0:08:51.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了  连这段对话都能挑起我的欲望
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.60,0:08:57.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Ross!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.60,0:08:57.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.32,0:08:59.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How's it going with you and Mona?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.32,0:08:59.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你跟蒙娜还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.38,0:09:01.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you guys still together?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.38,0:09:01.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们还在一起吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.51,0:09:05.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, we're moving forward. You'll be getting our card.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.51,0:09:05.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  我们有所进展  你们会收到我们的卡片
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.33,0:09:09.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're doing a holiday card together?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.33,0:09:09.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们要一起寄节日贺卡吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.66,0:09:11.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're not just doing a card.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.66,0:09:11.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不只要寄节日贺卡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.24,0:09:13.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She also wants to have the conversation...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.24,0:09:13.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她还要谈一谈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.15,0:09:15.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...about where the relationship is going.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.15,0:09:15.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们会有什么结局
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.37,0:09:17.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Women!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.37,0:09:17.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}女人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.86,0:09:21.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know! Why do you guys need to have this conversation?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.86,0:09:21.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是嘛  为什么你们想要谈这种问题
